5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! Since it's Day 0, we don't have any clues yet, but I'm going to find that werewolf no matter what. Who do you guys think looks suspicious already?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"It is far too early to cast suspicion, Takumi. Let us observe each other's behavior first. I prefer to make a judgment based on evidence rather than first impressions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree with George! Let's keep things friendly for now. But I'm excited to see how this goes! Does anyone have a strategy they want to share?,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I think we should all talk a lot! If we talk more, the werewolf might get nervous and say something weird, right? I'm going to be watching everyone very closely!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, that's a great idea! I'll be talking plenty. @Misaki, you're being awfully quiet. Is there a reason you're skipping your turns already?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,I believe Misaki is simply reflecting on the situation. There is no need to pressure her immediately; silence can be as telling as speech if we are patient.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Exactly! Let's give her some space. Maybe she's just thinking of a really clever way to catch the werewolf! Right, Misaki?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm just listening to everyone. I don't have anything specific to add yet, but I'm paying attention.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"I knew it! Misaki-san is just being shy! But I'm still going to keep an eye on you, just in case you're a sneaky wolf! Hehe!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we're just observing, then I'll keep pushing for answers. @George, you're very calm, almost too calm. Do you think you can help us spot the wolf with all that experience of yours?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"I will certainly do my best. However, experience teaches us that the most dangerous predators are often those who blend in perfectly. I shall remain observant of everyone's patterns.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds so mysterious, George! I'll try to blend in too—wait, I mean, I'll try to help you spot the one who's blending in! This is getting intense already!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Yumi, you're acting a bit too energetic. It's a bit distracting, though I'm sure you're just being yourself.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, Misaki-san is finally talking more! But Yumi-chan is always like that, she's just a ball of energy! I think it's fun, but maybe the wolf is trying to hide behind all that noise!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"That's a point, Rin. @Yumi, you're definitely making a lot of noise. Let's see if that energy stays the same tomorrow once we actually have some results to talk about.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,"Indeed. Tomorrow will be the true test of our observations. For now, let us all rest and prepare ourselves for the first day of voting.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'll be ready! I'm going to sleep with a big smile on my face, but I'll be dreaming of ways to protect everyone! Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. I hope we all wake up safely tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight! I'm going to dream about being a super detective and catching the wolf red-handed! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Takumi,Yumi,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Yumi""}"
