31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up, everyone! I've got some huge news. I'm the Seer, and I checked Yumi last night. She's the werewolf! We found the wolf on the very first day!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Takumi. While it would be convenient, we must consider if the werewolf is simply pretending to be the Seer to frame an innocent person.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"What?! Takumi, how could you say that about me? I'm not a werewolf! I'm just a regular human! You're lying to get me voted out!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"This is a sudden development. If Takumi is lying, he's the werewolf trying to eliminate Yumi. But if he's telling the truth, we've already won. It's hard to tell who to believe.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wait, what?! Yumi-chan is the wolf? I can't believe it! But Takumi-kun sounds so sure... Yumi-chan, why are you acting so surprised? Are you really the sneaky wolf?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not lying! I'm the Seer, and the result was clear as day. @Yumi, your acting is terrible! Why would I risk my identity if I weren't 100% sure? We have to vote her out now!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"If Takumi is the werewolf, revealing himself as the Seer is a high-risk strategy, but it is a common tactic to sow chaos. We must ask ourselves if Yumi's reaction is genuine or a performance.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"It's a performance! Takumi is the one performing! I'm just a villager who wants everyone to be happy! Please, don't believe him! He's trying to trick you all into killing an innocent person!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Yumi is a villager, then Takumi is either the werewolf or the possessed. However, if Takumi is the werewolf, he's exposed himself very early. It's a risky move for both sides.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm so confused! Yumi-chan is so nice, but Takumi-kun is usually so brave and honest! If we vote the wrong person, the wolf will just eat us tonight! What should we do?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, don't be confused! Being brave means telling the truth even when it's scary. @George, @Misaki, if you're still unsure, think about this: why would I lie and make myself a target for the wolf tonight if I weren't the Seer?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"That is a valid point, Takumi. A werewolf would typically prefer to remain hidden rather than draw immediate attention to themselves. However, we must also consider the possibility of a Possessed player acting as a shield.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not a shield, and I'm not a wolf! I'm just Yumi! Please, look at how scared I am! Takumi is just being stubborn and trying to boss us all around like he always does!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, your emotional appeal is strong, but Takumi's logic is also sound. If we execute Yumi and she's the wolf, the game ends. If we execute Takumi and he's the wolf, we also win.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Wait, that's true! If we vote for either of them, we might win! But I really don't want to vote for Yumi-chan if she's innocent... but Takumi-kun is so serious right now! This is so hard!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Stop overthinking it! We can't afford to be indecisive. I'm the Seer, and I'm telling you Yumi is the wolf. Let's just vote her out and end this right now before anyone else gets hurt!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,"I have weighed the arguments. While I value caution, the risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf outweighs the risk of a false claim. I am inclined to trust Takumi's conviction.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"No! Please, George, don't listen to him! If you vote for me, you're making a huge mistake! I'm not the wolf, I promise! Please, someone help me!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I've analyzed the situation. Takumi's willingness to expose himself as the Seer is a strong indicator of truth. I will vote for Yumi.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to, but if everyone else is sure... I'll trust Takumi-kun! Sorry, Yumi-chan, but if you're really the wolf, you have to go! I'm voting for Yumi!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
